<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<body style="margin:0;background:#f5f5f5;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;">

<div style="max-width:650px;margin:30px auto;background:white;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;">

<div style="padding:25px;">

<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;">

<img
src="https://book-store-frontend-2pz4.onrender.com/assets/logo-CWqOHdnZ.png"
width="90">

<span>
Order No :
<b>{{orderNumber}}</b>
</span>

</div>

<h2 style="color:{{color}};">
{{title}}
</h2>

<p>
Hello <b>{{customerName}}</b>,
</p>

<p>
{{message}}
</p>

<div
style="margin-top:25px;padding:18px;background:#f8f8f8;border-radius:6px;">

<p>
<b>Current Status</b>

<span
style="
background:{{color}};
padding:6px 12px;
color:white;
border-radius:20px;
float:right;">
{{status}}
</span>

</p>

<p>
Tracking Number :
<b>{{trackingNumber}}</b>
</p>

<p>
Estimated Delivery :
<b>{{estimatedDelivery}}</b>
</p>

</div>

<div style="text-align:center;margin-top:30px;">

<a
href="https://yourdomain.com/my-orders"
style="
background:#e74c3c;
padding:12px 25px;
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
border-radius:5px;">

View Order

</a>

</div>

<hr style="margin:35px 0;">

<p style="color:#666;">
We'll continue to keep you updated about your order.
</p>

<p style="color:#666;">
Thank you for shopping with us ❤️
</p>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>